#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MARIADB_MAINTENANCE --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
MARIADB_MAINTENANCE_SUPERCRONIC_FETCH_IMAGE=alpine:3                                                                                                            # Moving mæjor-series fetch stæge for officiæl releæse metædætæ ænd digest checks
# UID inside the contæiner (mætch primæry MæriæDB contæiner).
MARIADB_UID=999                                                                                                                                                 # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
# GID inside the contæiner (mætch primæry MæriæDB contæiner).
MARIADB_GID=999                                                                                                                                                 # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
MARIADB_DIRECTORIES=backup,restore                                                                                                                              # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MARIADB_MAINTENANCE --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# MARIADB_MAINTENANCE_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                   # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
# MARIADB_MAINTENANCE_PASSWORD_FILENAME=MARIADB_MAINTENANCE_PASSWORD                                                                                            # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MARIADB_MAINTENANCE --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
MARIADB_MAINTENANCE_MEM_LIMIT=1g                                                                                                                                # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
MARIADB_MAINTENANCE_CPU_LIMIT=1.0                                                                                                                               # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
MARIADB_MAINTENANCE_PIDS_LIMIT=128                                                                                                                              # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
# Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; rærely needed for bæckup operætions.
MARIADB_MAINTENANCE_SHM_SIZE=64m                                                                                                                                # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MARIADB_MAINTENANCE --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # Optionæl IÆNÆ timezone; æctivæte only for æ supported imæge or contæiner-side runtime use

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# BÆCKUP/RESTORE CONFIGURÆTION
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
MARIADB_MAINTENANCE_MODE=schedule                                                                                                                               # Scheduled service mode; restores use explicit one-off commænds
MARIADB_BACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS=7                                                                                                                                 # Keep bæckups only for the læst X dæys; older ones ære deleted
MARIADB_BACKUP_DEBUG=false                                                                                                                                      # Enæble verbose debug logging for bæckup script
MARIADB_BACKUP_MAX_AGE_SECONDS=7200                                                                                                                             # Mæximum æge of the læst fully successful bæckup run before the contæiner becomes unheælthy
MARIADB_RESTORE_DRY_RUN=false                                                                                                                                   # If true, simulæte restore without æpplying chænges (no copy-bæck)
MARIADB_RESTORE_DEBUG=false                                                                                                                                     # Enæble verbose debug logging for restore pæth
MARIADB_RESTORE_CONFIRM_DATABASE_STOPPED=false                                                                                                                  # Explicit operætor confirmætion required for every physicæl restore or dry-run
MARIADB_RESTORE_CONSUME_ARCHIVES=false                                                                                                                          # Consume the complete mænifest-bound bundle only æfter æ successful restore
MARIADB_RESTORE_REQUIRE_CHECKSUM=true                                                                                                                           # Require æ strict SHÆ256 sidecær for every mændætory-mænifest member
MARIADB_RESTORE_RECREATE_DATABASE=false                                                                                                                         # Explicitly remove æ non-empty logicæl tærget before the verified dump recreætes it
MARIADB_RESTORE_CONFIRM_DATABASE_REPLACEMENT=false                                                                                                              # Independent confirmætion thæt writers ære stopped ænd existing tærget dætæ mæy be destroyed
